; ============================================================================
; BSYS_IntelShieldUDF
; ============================================================================
; Clears the one-frame click shield armed whenever an intel box is shown
; (BSYS_IntelListUDF / BSYS_IntelAskUDF). Scheduled via CallAfterFrames 1
; with the menu-mode flag - the same re-trigger guard idiom MCM Extender
; uses. While the shield is up, the box callbacks re-show their box
; instead of processing the click. CallAfterFrames timers flush on load,
; so InitLoadUDF also resets the flag - a load can never strand it.
; ============================================================================

Create: BSYS_IntelShieldUDF

Begin Function {}
  Goo1.AuxVarSetFlt "*_BSYS_bBoxShield" 0
End
